<figure class="jev-boundary" aria-labelledby="jev-boundary-caption">
  <svg
    class="jev-boundary__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 370"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="jev-boundary-title jev-boundary-desc"
  >
    <title id="jev-boundary-title">從模型分佈到 action 的控制邊界</title>
    <desc id="jev-boundary-desc"
      >模型分佈要先通過完整候選集合與單 token
      標籤檢查，再經標記資料校準的門檻；任一失敗交由人工或回退，通過後仍由確定性政策決定是否允許
      action。</desc
    >
    <defs
      ><marker
        id="jev-boundary-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 8 8"
        refX="7"
        refY="4"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
        ><path class="jev-boundary__arrow-head" d="M 0 0 L 8 4 L 0 8 z"
        ></path></marker
      ></defs
    >
    <path
      class="jev-boundary__arrow"
      d="M184 174H236"
      marker-end="url(#jev-boundary-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="jev-boundary__arrow"
      d="M404 174H456"
      marker-end="url(#jev-boundary-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="jev-boundary__arrow jev-boundary__arrow--allow"
      d="M624 174H676"
      marker-end="url(#jev-boundary-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="jev-boundary__arrow jev-boundary__arrow--fallback"
      d="M320 242V258Q320 266 328 266H396V282"
      marker-end="url(#jev-boundary-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="jev-boundary__arrow jev-boundary__arrow--fallback"
      d="M540 242V258Q540 266 548 266H668V282"
      marker-end="url(#jev-boundary-arrow)"></path>
    <rect
      class="jev-boundary__label-mask"
      x="331"
      y="254"
      width="30"
      height="18"
      rx="4"></rect><text
      class="jev-boundary__branch-label"
      x="346"
      y="267"
      text-anchor="middle">否</text
    >
    <rect
      class="jev-boundary__label-mask"
      x="551"
      y="254"
      width="30"
      height="18"
      rx="4"></rect><text
      class="jev-boundary__branch-label"
      x="566"
      y="267"
      text-anchor="middle">否</text
    >
    <rect
      class="jev-boundary__label-mask"
      x="637"
      y="145"
      width="30"
      height="18"
      rx="4"></rect><text
      class="jev-boundary__branch-label"
      x="652"
      y="158"
      text-anchor="middle">是</text
    >
    <g class="jev-boundary__node" transform="translate(32 126)"
      ><rect width="152" height="96" rx="8"></rect><text
        class="jev-boundary__eyebrow"
        x="16"
        y="28">MODEL SIGNAL</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__title" x="16" y="56">候選分佈</text><text
        class="jev-boundary__detail"
        x="16"
        y="78">不是授權</text
      ></g
    >
    <g class="jev-boundary__decision" transform="translate(236 106)"
      ><path d="M84 0 L168 68 L84 136 L0 68 Z"></path><text
        class="jev-boundary__title"
        x="84"
        y="56"
        text-anchor="middle">每個標籤</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__detail" x="84" y="78" text-anchor="middle"
        >一 token 且有</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__detail" x="84" y="98" text-anchor="middle"
        >ESCALATE？</text
      ></g
    >
    <g class="jev-boundary__decision" transform="translate(456 106)"
      ><path d="M84 0 L168 68 L84 136 L0 68 Z"></path><text
        class="jev-boundary__title"
        x="84"
        y="56"
        text-anchor="middle">經標記資料</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__detail" x="84" y="78" text-anchor="middle"
        >校準的機率與</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__detail" x="84" y="98" text-anchor="middle"
        >margin 通過？</text
      ></g
    >
    <g
      class="jev-boundary__node jev-boundary__node--allow"
      transform="translate(676 126)"
      ><rect width="244" height="96" rx="8"></rect><text
        class="jev-boundary__eyebrow"
        x="16"
        y="28">DETERMINISTIC POLICY</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__title" x="16" y="56">程式決定 action</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__detail" x="16" y="78"
        >權限與副作用另行檢查</text
      ></g
    >
    <g
      class="jev-boundary__node jev-boundary__node--fallback"
      transform="translate(356 282)"
      ><rect width="356" height="64" rx="8"></rect><text
        class="jev-boundary__eyebrow"
        x="16"
        y="25">SAFE FALLBACK</text
      ><text class="jev-boundary__title" x="16" y="49"
        >人工審核、固定規則或 System 2</text
      ></g
    >
  </svg>
  <div class="jev-boundary__mobile" aria-label="模型分佈的安全控制流程">
    <div>
      <span>1</span><strong>模型只給分佈</strong><p>
        分數是訊號，不是 action 的授權。
      </p>
    </div><b>↓</b>
    <div>
      <span>2</span><strong>檢查候選集合</strong><p>
        每個標籤一 token，並保留 ESCALATE。
      </p>
    </div><b>↓</b>
    <div>
      <span>3</span><strong>檢查校準門檻</strong><p>
        用標記資料驗證 probability 與 margin。
      </p>
    </div><b>↓</b>
    <div class="jev-boundary__mobile-allow">
      <span>4</span><strong>確定性政策再決定 action</strong><p>
        權限、allowlist 與人工核准不交給模型。
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="jev-boundary__mobile-fallback">
      任何一步失敗：人工審核、固定回退或 System 2。
    </p>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="jev-boundary-caption">
    圖：校準能協助選擇下一步；它不會取代授權、最小權限或不可逆動作的人工核准。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .jev-boundary {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }
  .jev-boundary__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .jev-boundary__mobile {
    display: none;
  }
  .jev-boundary__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .jev-boundary__arrow--allow {
    stroke: #3f8053;
  }
  .jev-boundary__arrow--fallback {
    stroke: #b35543;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
  }
  .jev-boundary__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }
  .jev-boundary__node rect,
  .jev-boundary__decision path {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .jev-boundary__node--allow rect {
    fill: #eef8f0;
    stroke: #3f8053;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .jev-boundary__node--fallback rect {
    fill: #fff1ed;
    stroke: #b35543;
  }
  .jev-boundary__eyebrow {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .jev-boundary__title {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .jev-boundary__detail {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .jev-boundary__label-mask {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
  }
  .jev-boundary__branch-label {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jev-boundary__node--allow rect {
    fill: #163722;
    stroke: #6fba84;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jev-boundary__node--fallback rect {
    fill: #43231d;
    stroke: #df826d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jev-boundary__label-mask {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .jev-boundary__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile {
      display: grid !important;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile > div {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile-allow {
      background: #eef8f0 !important;
      border-color: #3f8053 !important;
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile span {
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile strong {
      color: var(--dg-ink);
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile p {
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile b {
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .jev-boundary__mobile-fallback {
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      border-left: 3px solid #b35543;
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
      padding-left: var(--space-sm);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jev-boundary__mobile-allow {
      background: #163722 !important;
      border-color: #6fba84 !important;
    }
  }
</style>
